# Portuguese translation pack for Hermes.
# Format: <canonical english>=<native form> (one per line, # = comment).
# Single native words are translated while reading a script; longer native
# phrases ("espada de diamante") are matched by the parser's greedy lookups.
# You may extend or override anything here by dropping a custom pt.lang into
# plugins/Hermes/lang/.

